# Unicode CLDR 47, locale ga, gregorian calendar (cldr-json
# cldr-dates-full/main/ga/ca-gregorian.json).
# The CLDR citation form is already the adverbial "Dé" + day
# compound ("on <day>"); the bare radical noun is the form a
# modified reference uses ("an Luan seo chugainn").  Both are
# listed.  Radical and genitive: en.wiktionary.org, the day's own
# headword entry.
Dé hAoine
Aoine
